    "detailed_description": "A Car That Turns attempts to capture the idea of mastery. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe controls are simple: turn left, turn right, and drift. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDon't let this simplicity fool you. The car's nuances during a drift will put your will and determination to the test. Sticking to it is worth the effort (getting that perfect drift feels so damn good). <br />\r\n<br />\r\nReach a state of flow as you try to beat your best times on Akina, Usui, Myogi, and Iro Hazaka Pass.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuilt by an Indie with love. No ads, no data collection, no IAPs, just game.",
    "about_the_game": "A Car That Turns attempts to capture the idea of mastery. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe controls are simple: turn left, turn right, and drift. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDon't let this simplicity fool you. The car's nuances during a drift will put your will and determination to the test. Sticking to it is worth the effort (getting that perfect drift feels so damn good). <br />\r\n<br />\r\nReach a state of flow as you try to beat your best times on Akina, Usui, Myogi, and Iro Hazaka Pass.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuilt by an Indie with love. No ads, no data collection, no IAPs, just game.",
